dev_notes_primitives:
The original design have too much foam on the water, i fixed by making a more organic look for the foam;
I recreated all the lighting to make it more realistic and improved the reflection shader to give more realism;
I recreated the terrain so that we have two headlands;
I improved the vortex to be more realistic, because in the original design it looks kinda off;
The scene overall was improved, with clouds in the sky, more detail water, etc.
The goal was to make a more natural and more realistic scene, keeping the limitations of three.js in mind.

